 {
  "path": "plugins/comment-review/skills/comment-review/scripts/galley.py",
  "start": 100,
  "end": 115,
  "kind": "docstring",
  "lines": 16,
  "text": "Do the file's lines equal the stored `raw_lines` for this block? ! The census may be older than the file. Splicing a range whose content has moved writes the replacement over whatever is there now, which is one of the two conditions `main` checks before it writes -- `overlaps` refuses the other. ! False also means COULD NOT BE CHECKED. A block carrying no `raw_lines` has nothing to compare and a range outside the file has nowhere to compare it, so both refuse rather than pass. !! A PYTHON DOCSTRING CAN NEVER PASS. `census.py` fills a structural docstring's `raw_lines` from the AST value, which carries no quote delimiters and no indent on its first line, so the comparison is between unlike things and answers False on an unmodified file.",
  "anchor": "block_matches",
  "tier": "tokenized",
  "annotations": [
   "cites-a-path",
   "forbids-a-literal",
   "names-a-symbol"
  ],
  "notes": [
   "UNRESOLVED path census.py",
   "GREP this file for what it forbids: 'no `raw_lines`'"
  ],
  "raw_lines": [
   "    \"\"\"Do the file's lines equal the stored `raw_lines` for this block?",
   "",
   "    ! The census may be older than the file. Splicing a range whose content has",
   "    moved writes the replacement over whatever is there now, which is one of",
   "    the two conditions `main` checks before it writes -- `overlaps` refuses the",
   "    other.",
   "",
   "    ! False also means COULD NOT BE CHECKED. A block carrying no `raw_lines`",
   "    has nothing to compare and a range outside the file has nowhere to compare",
   "    it, so both refuse rather than pass.",
   "",
   "    !! A PYTHON DOCSTRING CAN NEVER PASS. `census.py` fills a structural",
   "    docstring's `raw_lines` from the AST value, which carries no quote",
   "    delimiters and no indent on its first line, so the comparison is between",
   "    unlike things and answers False on an unmodified file.",
   "    \"\"\""
  ]
 },
